WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.516 --> 00:00:08.516
(bubbly music)

00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:14.569
- Hey Mia, have you seen my phone?

00:00:14.569 --> 00:00:18.149
- No. Oh I did see one
in the women's bathroom.

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:19.714
- Oh yay!

00:00:19.714 --> 00:00:22.004
- Yes I'd love a glass
of the pinot grigio.

00:00:22.004 --> 00:00:24.120
- [Waitress] Great, I'm just
going to need to see your ID.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.037
- Sure.

00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:27.120
- Oh my God.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.894
- Um.

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:30.168
- You know I changed wallets.

00:00:30.168 --> 00:00:33.064
I think I left it in my other wallet.

00:00:33.064 --> 00:00:35.612
- [Woman] Hey can
anybody bring me a towel?

00:00:35.612 --> 00:00:36.500
Is anybody home?

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.242
- We're like really excited to have you.

00:00:38.242 --> 00:00:39.437
Hey Michelle!

00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:41.182
This is our new intern, Stacey.

00:00:41.182 --> 00:00:42.156
- Hi, nice to meet you.

00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:43.468
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:43.468 --> 00:00:46.743
- Thank you so much, I gotta go.

00:00:46.743 --> 00:00:48.443
- Wait, what was her name?

00:00:48.443 --> 00:00:49.276
- Seriously?

00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:51.903
- Hey, Mia do you have a
phone charger I can borrow?

00:00:51.903 --> 00:00:53.307
Thank you so much.

00:00:53.307 --> 00:00:57.914
I'll get it right back,
just need it for 10 minutes.

00:00:57.914 --> 00:00:59.747
Oh yay that's tonight.

00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:03.405
That's tonight?

00:01:03.405 --> 00:01:04.738
Oh God, no.

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:10.020
Are you kidding me?

00:01:11.648 --> 00:01:13.065
Dammit!

00:01:15.239 --> 00:01:16.406
Oh no.

00:01:20.286 --> 00:01:22.894
Did I leave the stove on?

00:01:22.894 --> 00:01:25.552
Oh no it says on Facebook that
it's Mia's birthday today.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:26.826
- Shoot! No I told her I'd take her

00:01:26.826 --> 00:01:28.436
to Disneyland for her birthday.

00:01:28.436 --> 00:01:29.415
- I really wanted to get her something

00:01:29.415 --> 00:01:31.818
cause she got me Beyonce
tickets for my birthday.

00:01:31.818 --> 00:01:33.890
- I didn't get her a Christmas present.

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.980
- Hey guys!
- Hi!

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.054
Happy birthday!

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:37.118
- Thank you!

00:01:37.118 --> 00:01:38.348
- We got you this snake.

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:39.312
- From both of us.

00:01:39.312 --> 00:01:40.218
- Thank you!

00:01:40.218 --> 00:01:41.750
- Since you love Britney Spears.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:42.600
- I love it.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.433
- Yay.

00:01:47.745 --> 00:01:51.245
(bubbly music)

